(7677043, 1255157, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love the image, particularly the softness. And I enjoy the surrounding environment. I think what makes this particularly good is all the verticals, it feels that they''re moving through them. Of course that wouldn''t have worked without the perfect POV which you also attained. The only thing I''m not in love with here is the title as I think the image fits the challenge without an explanation.</td>', 'Love the image, particularly the softness. And I enjoy the surrounding environment. I think what makes this particularly good is all the verticals, it feels that they''re moving through them. Of course that wouldn''t have worked without the perfect POV which you also attained. The only thing I''m not in love with here is the title as I think the image fits the challenge without an explanation.', '2020-10-17 15:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
