(7677353, 1255116, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings form the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Hey Marac! Good photo, and it definitely meets the challenge. I personally gave this an 8, and I love the title! I really love all the detail in the face. I don''t really like the pose the pig is doing and it just looks stiff (unless it''s not a real pig) I would''ve had the pug side facing you with it''s head turned to you. The exposure is great, and I''m going to say it again, the detail in the face is <b><i>outstanding</i></b>. And all in all great photo and you just missed out on top 10. Good luck on future challenges!<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me with any questions.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings form the Critique Club! Hey Marac! Good photo, and it definitely meets the challenge. I personally gave this an 8, and I love the title! I really love all the detail in the face. I don''t really like the pose the pig is doing and it just looks stiff (unless it''s not a real pig) I would''ve had the pug side facing you with it''s head turned to you. The exposure is great, and I''m going to say it again, the detail in the face is outstanding. And all in all great photo and you just missed out on top 10. Good luck on future challenges! Feel free to PM me with any questions. ', '2020-10-21 08:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
